// Shared concrete B3 records. IDs are one-based; capacity is checked before append.
module bootstrap::model;
// Stable discriminants. Primitive TypeIds TYPE_UNIT..TYPE_USIZE equal their kinds.
// Ordered ranges below are intentional: scalar types, comparisons and IR terminators.
